"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">45</div><h1>어순 심화 — 가운데 자리와 뒷자리</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Wortstellung im Mittelfeld und im Nachfeld</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 45의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>C1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 · 보강 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">가운데 자리에서 대명사 · 아는 정보 · 새 정보를 알맞은 순서로 놓아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">문장 전체의 nicht와 일부만 부정하는 nicht … sondern을 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">비교의 als · wie와 und zwar를 뒷자리에 놓아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">첫 자리에 성분 하나만 놓고, 앞 문장을 받는 말로 문장을 이어요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">바꿔 쓰기는 문장 전체를 써요. 쉼표와 마침표는 채점하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">틀린 곳 찾기는 문장에서 틀린 단어 하나를 눌러요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">푼 답은 이 기기에 저장돼요. 새로고침하거나 앱을 업데이트해도 남아 있어요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"ad6e78b6cb\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Ich habe das Buch meiner Schwester geliehen.<br>→ Ich habe <span class=\"qblank\"></span> geliehen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) es ihr</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) ihm sie</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) ihr es</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) sie ihm</button></div><div class=\"qe\">대명사끼리는 4격이 3격보다 앞에 와요. das Buch → es, meiner Schwester → ihr.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"453e9af694\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> 맞는 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Wir fliegen im Sommer nicht nach Spanien.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) Wir fliegen nicht im Sommer nach Spanien nicht.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) Wir fliegen im Sommer nach Spanien nicht.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Wir nicht fliegen im Sommer nach Spanien.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">문장 전체를 부정하는 nicht는 방향을 나타내는 말(nach Spanien) 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"ec5ea8d875\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> 맞는 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) Sie ist schneller als geschwommen ihre Schwester.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) Als ihre Schwester sie ist schneller geschwommen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) Sie ist schneller geschwommen als ihre Schwester.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) Sie ist als ihre Schwester schneller geschwommen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">비교의 als는 문장 끝의 동사(geschwommen) 뒤, 뒷자리에 둬요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"c6b466574a\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> 맞는 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) Am Wochenende meine Großeltern wir besuchen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Am Wochenende besuchen wir meine Großeltern.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) Am Wochenende wir besuchen meine Großeltern.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Wir am Wochenende besuchen meine Großeltern.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">첫 자리에는 성분 하나만 와요. 동사 besuchen이 두 번째, 주어 wir는 그 뒤예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e4c4378527\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> '누구에게 줬는지'가 새 정보인 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Ich habe die Blumen einer Nachbarin geschenkt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) Ich habe der Nachbarin Blumen geschenkt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) Ich habe ihr die Blumen geschenkt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Ich habe sie ihr geschenkt.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">아는 것(die Blumen)은 앞에, 새 정보(einer Nachbarin)는 뒤에 와요. 부정관사가 붙은 말이 새 정보예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"ef9155c046\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;als&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Er hat mehr gegessen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(비교)</span> ich.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 나보다 더 많이 먹었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Er hat mehr gegessen <b>als</b> ich.</div>비교급 + als. als ich는 과거분사 gegessen 뒤, 뒷자리에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"1e6ee1a74c\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;wie&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Sie hat genauso lange gewartet <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(비교)</span> wir.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 우리만큼 오래 기다렸어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Sie hat genauso lange gewartet <b>wie</b> wir.</div>genauso … wie = ~만큼. wie wir도 뒷자리에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"c10b3a399f\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;sondern&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Nicht mein Bruder, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> meine Schwester studiert in Wien.</div><div class=\"qko\">빈에서 공부하는 건 오빠가 아니라 언니예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Nicht mein Bruder, <b>sondern</b> meine Schwester studiert in Wien.</div>일부만 부정할 때는 그 말 바로 앞에 nicht를 두고 sondern으로 바로잡아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"7877c46f0f\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;zwar&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Wir haben das Haus verkauft, und <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> bereits vor drei Jahren.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 그 집을 팔았어요, 그것도 벌써 3년 전에요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir haben das Haus verkauft, und <b>zwar</b> bereits vor drei Jahren.</div>und zwar는 앞말을 더 자세히 밝힐 때 써요. 문장 끝의 동사 뒤, 뒷자리에 덧붙여요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"33772665fd\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ihn&quot;],[&quot;ihm&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Ich habe dem Nachbarn den Schlüssel gegeben.<br>→ Ich habe <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(den Schlüssel → 대명사)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(dem Nachbarn → 대명사)</span> gegeben.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 이웃에게 열쇠를 줬어요. → 나는 그에게 그것을 줬어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich habe dem Nachbarn den Schlüssel gegeben.<br>→ Ich habe <b>ihn</b> <b>ihm</b> gegeben.</div>대명사끼리는 4격(ihn) → 3격(ihm) 순서예요. 명사끼리일 때와 순서가 반대예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"dd9d35ffa9\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Dort&quot;,&quot;Da&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Letzte Woche war ich in einem kleinen Dorf in den Alpen. <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(거기)</span> gibt es nur ein einziges Geschäft.</div><div class=\"qko\">지난주에 알프스의 작은 마을에 있었어요. 거기에는 가게가 하나뿐이에요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Letzte Woche war ich in einem kleinen Dorf in den Alpen. <b>Dort</b> gibt es nur ein einziges Geschäft.</div>앞 문장의 끝(in einem kleinen Dorf)을 Dort로 받아 첫 자리에 놓으면 글이 이어져요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"cd4541071f\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Sie hat ihn mir heute Morgen gezeigt&quot;,&quot;Heute Morgen hat sie ihn mir gezeigt&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀가 오늘 아침에 나에게 그것(ihn)을 보여 줬어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Morgen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">hat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">gezeigt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Sie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">mir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">ihn</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Sie hat ihn mir heute Morgen gezeigt.</b></div>대명사가 가운데 자리의 맨 앞에 와요. 4격 ihn → 3격 mir → 시간 순서예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5b1ebb4acf\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir sind gestern wegen der Kälte mit dem Taxi nach Hause gefahren&quot;,&quot;Gestern sind wir wegen der Kälte mit dem Taxi nach Hause gefahren&quot;,&quot;Wegen der Kälte sind wir gestern mit dem Taxi nach Hause gefahren&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 어제 추위 때문에 택시를 타고 집에 갔어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">nach</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Hause</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Kälte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">wegen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">mit</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">dem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">gestern</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">sind</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">Taxi</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"11\">gefahren</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir sind gestern wegen der Kälte mit dem Taxi nach Hause gefahren.</b></div>부사어는 시간 → 이유 → 방법 순서로 놓아요. 방향(nach Hause)은 동사에 딸린 말이라서 맨 뒤예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e9865249c3\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Er hat sich nicht für das Geschenk bedankt&quot;,&quot;Er hat sich für das Geschenk nicht bedankt&quot;,&quot;Für das Geschenk hat er sich nicht bedankt&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 선물을 받고도 고맙다고 하지 않았어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">hat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Geschenk</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Er</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">bedankt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">für</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">sich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">das</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Er hat sich nicht für das Geschenk bedankt.</b></div>문장 전체의 nicht는 보통 전치사 목적어(für das Geschenk) 앞에 와요. 재귀대명사 sich는 동사 바로 뒤예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"7fd60ae840\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Fahrt hat länger gedauert als wir gedacht hatten&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">가는 길은 우리가 생각했던 것보다 오래 걸렸어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">gedacht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">als</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">hatten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Fahrt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">gedauert</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">hat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">länger</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Fahrt hat länger gedauert, als wir gedacht hatten.</b></div>비교의 als 문장은 문장 끝의 동사 gedauert 뒤, 뒷자리에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e8b88c8d17\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Gestern hat mir meine Tante ein Paket geschickt&quot;,&quot;Gestern hat meine Tante mir ein Paket geschickt&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 'Gestern'으로 시작해서 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">어제 이모가 나에게 소포를 보냈어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Tante</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">ein</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">hat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Gestern</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">geschickt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Paket</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">meine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">mir</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Gestern hat mir meine Tante ein Paket geschickt.</b></div>대명사 mir는 명사 주어 meine Tante보다 앞에 올 수 있어요. 새 정보 ein Paket은 뒤에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"f97c2ced32\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Sie hat nicht ihren Bruder angerufen, <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) sondern zu Hause</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) sondern gestern</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) sondern ihre Schwester</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) sondern geschrieben</button></div><div class=\"qe\">nicht가 ihren Bruder 바로 앞에 있으니 '누구에게'만 부정해요. sondern 뒤에도 사람이 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"cd494aabdb\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> 'Was hast du mit dem alten Fahrrad gemacht?'에 가장 자연스러운 대답은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) Ich habe einem Studenten das Fahrrad verkauft.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Ich habe das Fahrrad einem Studenten verkauft.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Ich habe verkauft das Fahrrad einem Studenten.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) Einem Studenten ich habe das Fahrrad verkauft.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">자전거는 이미 아는 것이라서 앞에, 새 정보인 einem Studenten은 뒤에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"adf7ec3844\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> In unserer Straße hat ein neues Café eröffnet.<br>이 문장에 가장 매끄럽게 이어지는 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) Dort es gibt den besten Kuchen der Stadt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Dort gibt es den besten Kuchen der Stadt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) Den besten Kuchen der Stadt dort gibt es.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Es dort gibt den besten Kuchen der Stadt.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">앞 문장의 새 정보(ein neues Café)를 Dort로 받아 첫 자리에 놓아요. 동사 gibt는 두 번째예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"4c12db7ac4\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;sondern&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Ich habe den Roman nicht gelesen, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> nur die Verfilmung gesehen.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 소설은 읽지 않고 영화로 만든 것만 봤어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich habe den Roman nicht gelesen, <b>sondern</b> nur die Verfilmung gesehen.</div>nicht …, sondern … = ~이 아니라. 앞말을 부정하고 바로잡을 때 aber가 아니라 sondern을 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"ad97b824ad\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;es&quot;],[&quot;dir&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Kannst du mir das Wörterbuch leihen? – Ja, ich leihe <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(das Wörterbuch → 대명사)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(너에게)</span> gern.</div><div class=\"qko\">사전 좀 빌려줄 수 있어? – 응, 기꺼이 빌려줄게.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Kannst du mir das Wörterbuch leihen? – Ja, ich leihe <b>es</b> <b>dir</b> gern.</div>대명사끼리는 4격(es)이 3격(dir)보다 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5f6179b2bf\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Der Vortrag war interessanter als ich erwartet hatte&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 강연은 내가 기대했던 것보다 재미있었어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">als</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Vortrag</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">interessanter</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">erwartet</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">war</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">hatte</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Der Vortrag war interessanter, als ich erwartet hatte.</b></div>비교의 als 문장은 뒷자리에 와요. als 문장 안에서는 동사 hatte가 끝에 가요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"f3810effc3\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Diesen Fehler mache ich bestimmt nicht noch einmal&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> 'Diesen Fehler'로 시작해서 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">이 실수는 분명히 다시 하지 않을 거예요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">einmal</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">noch</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">mache</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">bestimmt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Fehler</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Diesen</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Diesen Fehler mache ich bestimmt nicht noch einmal.</b></div>목적어를 첫 자리에 놓으면 그 말이 강조돼요. 동사 mache가 두 번째, 주어 ich는 그 뒤예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"548ca8308f\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Stadt hat seit 2020 viel Geld in neue Radwege investiert&quot;,&quot;Seit 2020 hat die Stadt viel Geld in neue Radwege investiert&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">시는 2020년부터 새 자전거 도로에 많은 돈을 들였어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">hat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">investiert</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Stadt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Geld</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">neue</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Radwege</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">in</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">seit</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">viel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">2020</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Stadt hat seit 2020 viel Geld in neue Radwege investiert.</b></div>시간이 먼저 오고, 전치사 목적어 in neue Radwege는 동사에 딸린 말이라서 investiert 바로 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"38e4c2a868\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) Erklärt habe ich es ihm schon zweimal.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) Ich habe es ihm schon zweimal erklärt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) Ich habe ihm es schon zweimal erklärt.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) Schon zweimal habe ich es ihm erklärt.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">대명사끼리는 4격 es가 3격 ihm보다 앞에 와요. 첫 자리에는 과거분사나 부사가 와도 돼요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"fa3ac7f407\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Nach monatelangem Streit haben sich die Nachbarn gestern vor Gericht auf eine Lösung geeinigt.<br>이 문장에서 가장 중요한 새 정보는?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) die Nachbarn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) auf eine Lösung</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) nach monatelangem Streit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) gestern</button></div><div class=\"qe\">새롭고 중요한 정보는 문장 끝쪽, 동사 바로 앞에 와요. 첫 자리의 말은 배경이에요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5bb80c31a9\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Sie&quot;],[&quot;Dort&quot;,&quot;Da&quot;],[&quot;Deshalb&quot;,&quot;Deswegen&quot;,&quot;Daher&quot;,&quot;Darum&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> Im Mai habe ich eine alte Schulfreundin wiedergetroffen. <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(그녀)</span> lebt seit zehn Jahren in Kanada. <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(거기서)</span> leitet sie ein kleines Hotel. <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(그래서)</span> kommt sie nur selten nach Deutschland.</div><div class=\"qko\">5월에 옛 학교 친구를 다시 만났어요. 그녀는 10년 전부터 캐나다에 살아요. 거기서 작은 호텔을 운영해요. 그래서 독일에는 가끔만 와요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Im Mai habe ich eine alte Schulfreundin wiedergetroffen. <b>Sie</b> lebt seit zehn Jahren in Kanada. <b>Dort</b> leitet sie ein kleines Hotel. <b>Deshalb</b> kommt sie nur selten nach Deutschland.</div>앞 문장의 새 정보를 다음 문장의 첫 자리에서 받아요 — eine Schulfreundin → Sie, in Kanada → Dort. 접속부사 뒤에는 동사가 바로 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"769443df81\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;nicht&quot;],[&quot;sondern&quot;],[&quot;zwar&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Wir sind <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(부정)</span> mit dem Auto, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(바로잡기)</span> mit dem Zug gefahren, und <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(덧붙이기)</span> erst am Samstag.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 차가 아니라 기차로 갔어요, 그것도 토요일에야 갔어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir sind <b>nicht</b> mit dem Auto, <b>sondern</b> mit dem Zug gefahren, und <b>zwar</b> erst am Samstag.</div>일부만 부정할 때는 그 말 바로 앞에 nicht, 바로잡을 때 sondern, 뒷자리에 덧붙일 때 und zwar를 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"29e14cd656\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Der Direktor hat ihnen gestern in einem Brief die neuen Regeln erklärt&quot;,&quot;Der Direktor hat ihnen die neuen Regeln gestern in einem Brief erklärt&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 'Der Direktor'로 시작해서 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">교장 선생님은 어제 편지로 그들에게 새 규칙을 설명했어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">neuen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">gestern</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">hat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Brief</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">einem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Regeln</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Direktor</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">in</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">erklärt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">Der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"11\">ihnen</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Der Direktor hat ihnen gestern in einem Brief die neuen Regeln erklärt.</b></div>대명사 ihnen이 가운데 자리의 맨 앞에 와요. 그 뒤에 시간 → 방법이 오고, 4격 목적어는 그 앞이나 뒤에 놓아요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e9909f1879\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir müssen den Vertrag kündigen und zwar noch in diesem Monat&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 계약을 해지해야 해요, 그것도 이번 달 안에요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Monat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">müssen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">kündigen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Vertrag</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">diesem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">in</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">noch</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">und</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">den</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">zwar</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir müssen den Vertrag kündigen, und zwar noch in diesem Monat.</b></div>und zwar로 덧붙이는 말은 문장 끝의 동사 kündigen 뒤, 뒷자리에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge plus-badge\">보강</span><span class=\"sub-title\">보강 문제 · 문장을 바꿔 쓰고, 틀린 단어를 찾아요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"75d4d9467c\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich habe sie ihr gezeigt.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">31.</strong> 두 목적어를 대명사로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Ich habe meiner Freundin die Fotos gezeigt.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 31\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich habe sie ihr gezeigt.</b></div>die Fotos → sie(4격), meiner Freundin → ihr(3격). 대명사는 4격이 먼저예요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5befb1b9a4\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir ziehen im Herbst nicht nach München.&quot;,&quot;Im Herbst ziehen wir nicht nach München.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">32.</strong> 문장 전체를 nicht로 부정하세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Wir ziehen im Herbst nach München.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 32\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir ziehen im Herbst nicht nach München.</b></div>문장 전체의 nicht는 방향을 나타내는 말(nach München) 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"755ea7ac25\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Gestern habe ich einen interessanten Vortrag gehört.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">33.</strong> 'Gestern'으로 시작하도록 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Ich habe gestern einen interessanten Vortrag gehört.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 33\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Gestern habe ich einen interessanten Vortrag gehört.</b></div>첫 자리에는 성분 하나만 와요. Gestern이 첫 자리에 오면 주어 ich는 동사 habe 뒤로 가요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"7a8fe8bf1a\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"5\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">34.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 아이는 다른 누구보다 크게 웃었어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">Kind</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">hat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">lauter</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">gelacht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">wie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">alle</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">anderen.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Das Kind hat lauter gelacht als alle anderen.</b></div>비교급(lauter) 뒤에는 als를 써요. wie는 genauso · so와 함께 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"f1df53a91b\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"3\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">35.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">축제를 준비한 건 선생님이 아니라 학생들이에요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">Lehrer,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">aber</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">Schüler</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">haben</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"8\">Fest</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"9\">organisiert.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Nicht der Lehrer, sondern die Schüler haben das Fest organisiert.</b></div>nicht로 부정한 말을 바로잡을 때는 sondern을 써요.</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"eb454d7696\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"4\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">36.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 그만뒀어요, 그것도 첫날에 바로요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Sie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">hat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">gekündigt,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">und</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">nämlich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">gleich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">am</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">ersten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"8\">Tag.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Sie hat gekündigt, und zwar gleich am ersten Tag.</b></div>앞말을 더 자세히 밝혀 덧붙일 때는 und zwar를 써요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"36\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 36</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"